    <briefdescription>
<para>Short-rate dynamics in the Black-Karasinski model. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The short-rate is here <formula id="293">\[ r_t = e^{\varphi(t) + x_t} \]</formula> where <formula id="294">$ \varphi(t) $</formula> is the deterministic time-dependent parameter (which can not be determined analytically) used for term-structure fitting and <formula id="295">$ x_t $</formula> is the state variable following an Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process. </para>    </detaileddescription>
